  "description": "*“There must be only one sun.”\n\n“Two suns would only burn the empire's people to death.”*\n\nAlexar, the Archmage who once commanded the empire. After being betrayed by his trusted and loyal friend, Gillian Tercios, he is reborn as a reckless swordsman in a small, remote fiefdom. To exact bloody vengeance upon Gillian, his once-beloved friend and the continent's sole 9-star swordsman, Archmage Alexar begins his move.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
